{"title": "Wild Magic: Teleport (Activate) (Sorcerer)", "pageid": 40130, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Wild_Magic:_Teleport_(Activate)_(Sorcerer)", "categories": ["Bonus actions", "Class actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wild_Magic_Teleport_Activate_Sorcerer.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Wild_Magic_Teleport_Activate_Sorcerer.webp/300px-Wild_Magic_Teleport_Activate_Sorcerer.webp, /w/images/9/9a/Wild_Magic_Teleport_Activate_Sorcerer.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Wild_Magic_Teleport_Activate_Sorcerer.webp/300px-Wild_Magic_Teleport_Activate_Sorcerer.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Wild_Magic_Teleport_Activate_Sorcerer.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Wild Magic: Teleport</b> is a special <a href=\"/wiki/Class_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class action\">class action</a> that is randomly granted by a <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_table_(Sorcerer)\" title=\"Wild Magic table (Sorcerer)\">wild magic effect</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Teleport to an unoccupied space you can see. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt>\n<dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.we